<title>CONGO: SOCCER-CONGO BEAT ZAMBIA 1-0 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-CONGO BEAT ZAMBIA 1-0 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>POINTE-NOIRE, Congo 1996-11-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Congo beat Zambia 1-0</p>
<p>(halftime 1-0) on Sunday in their African zone group three World</p>
<p>Cup qualifier.</p>
<p>Scorer: Olivier Niere 41</p>
<p>Attendance: 40,000</p>
